{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52780","headline":"句 · 张彦雄","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云壑凝寒阴，岩泉激幽响。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷二六《历代吟谱》引殷璠语引）（殷璠曰：「彦雄诗但责潇洒，不尚绮密，至如『云壑凝寒阴，岩泉激幽响』，亦非凡俗之所能至也。\n」今按：此爲璠辑《丹阳集》佚文，详拙文《殷璠〈丹阳集〉辑考》〖刊《唐代文学论丛》第八辑〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张彦雄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}